Certainly! Using Redis for caching game state snapshots can significantly reduce the load on your database and improve the performance of your game. Here's a step-by-step guide on how to implement Redis caching for game state snapshots.

### Step 1: Set Up Redis

First, ensure that Redis is installed and running. You can install Redis using the following command:

```sh
