    volumes:
      - ./rabbitmq_data:/var/lib/rabbitmq
    command: rabbitmq-server
```

### Step 2: Initialize the Cluster

After starting the containers, you need to initialize the cluster. You can do this by connecting to one of the nodes and adding the other nodes to the cluster.

#### Example Commands

```sh
