### Step 5: Create Producer and Consumer

Once the transports are set up, you can create producers and consumers to handle the media streams.

```javascript
async function createProducer(transport, stream) {
  const producer = await transport.produce({
    kind: 'audio',
    rtpParameters: stream.getAudioTracks()[0].getTrack().getRtpSender().rtpParameters
  });

  console.log('Producer created:', producer.id);

  return producer;
