To handle expired card tokens and support multiple payment gateways like Stripe and PayPal, you'll need to refactor your code to include error handling for expired tokens and abstract the payment processing logic into a more generic function that can work with different gateways. Here's how you can do it:

### Step 1: Abstract the Payment Processing Logic
